---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import content from '../../content/page-content.json';
const { site } = content;
---
<BaseLayout title={`Privacy | ${site.legalName}`}>
  <section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Your enquiry, handled clearly.</h1></section>
  <section class="prose section">
    <h2>Training Enquiries</h2>
    <p>When you send a Training Enquiry, the form collects your name, work email address, company, training interest, and message, together with your consent to be contacted. KMSC uses this only to understand and respond to your request.</p>
    <p>The form is delivered by Formspree, a third-party service that receives and stores your submission so it can be forwarded to KMSC by email. Your enquiry is processed on Formspree's servers, which are located outside India.</p>

    <h2>Spam protection</h2>
    <p>The Training Enquiry form uses Google reCAPTCHA to distinguish people from automated submissions. Google receives your IP address and information about your browser and interaction with the page, and it sets cookies in your browser for this purpose. This happens only on the Contact page.</p>

    <h2>Typefaces</h2>
    <p>Every page loads its typefaces from Google Fonts. Your browser requests these files directly from Google's servers, so Google receives your IP address and basic information about your browser whenever you view a page.</p>

    <h2>What this website does not do</h2>
    <p>KMSC does not use analytics, advertising pixels, or behavioural tracking on this website, and the website sets no cookies of its own. The web server does not keep per-request access logs. Aside from the services named above, your information is not shared with anyone else, and it is not sold.</p>

    <h2>Questions and requests</h2>
    <p>To ask what KMSC holds about you, to correct it, or to ask for it to be deleted, contact KMSC through the <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
